[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (left and right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>2. Move the light cluster (2a) releasing the pin and retainer from\nits housing (2b).</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b, 3c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235988\">F11A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235997\">F11B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237001\">N31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Recover the light cluster.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070083.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the light cluster is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\nposition the light cluster attaching the pin and retainer in its housing.</p><p>Tighten the nuts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (left and right)</p>"]]